Hi Martha,

While preparing the referring physician directory for the new Sleep Lab SharePoint system, I identified approximately 211 groups of potential duplicate physician names.

Many physicians appear multiple times with different spelling, capitalization, name order, or professional credentials.

I have attached an Excel file for your review. Could you please complete the following three columns?

- **Approved Physician Name:** The correct name we should use in the new system.
- **Review Status:** Confirm whether the variations represent the same physician, different physicians, or require further investigation.
- **Review Comments:** Provide any additional clarification, especially when the names belong to different physicians.

This validation will help us create a clean physician directory and accurately associate the 2026 patient study records with the correct referring physicians during migration.

Thank you for your assistance.
